<title>USA: Teamsters' Carey to hold news conference.</title>
<headline>Teamsters' Carey to hold news conference.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The president of the Teamsters union, Ron Carey, will hold a &quot;major news conference&quot; to discuss developments in the 15-day-old strike against United Parcel Service, the Teamsters said on Monday.</p>
<p>The Teamsters gave no other details on the content of the pending news conference, which was to take place at Teamsters' headquarters here at 10:15 p.m. EDT (0215 GMT Tuesday).</p>
</text>
